{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>29歲香港首位赴日發展的AV女優素海霖（繪麗奈），過去因進軍日本暗黑界一戰成名，近年雖歷經合約爭議、官司纏身以及社群帳號接連遭封禁等低潮，卻依然擋不住她的高人氣。</p><p>面對舊帳號解封無望，她選擇樂觀重啟，近日悄悄開設全新的Instagram帳號重新出發，短短幾天便祭出超狂火辣福利吸引大批粉絲朝聖，再度引爆話題！但有粉絲發現，新帳號「thisisshl2026」竟又再度被封。</p><figure><img alt=\"素海霖（繪麗奈）近日悄悄開設全新的Instagram帳號重新出發，但有粉絲發現，新帳號「thisisshl2026」竟又再度被封。（IG@thisisshl）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187733335330263040261435.jpeg/toGDJLhA3scbHfYOrn8jPuEaV4AXRqkjVcpKWVXKSlk\"/><figcaption>素海霖（繪麗奈）近日悄悄開設全新的Instagram帳號重新出發，但有粉絲發現，新帳號「thisisshl2026」竟又再度被封。（IG@thisisshl）</figcaption></figure><p>更多素海霖（繪麗奈）開設新帳號曬出的照片：</p><figure><img alt=\"素海霖（繪麗奈）悄悄開設全新的Instagram帳號，短短幾天便祭出超狂火辣福利。（IG@thisisshl2026）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187733725958377472910423.jpeg/nhexZWj4uCbCaTUuizX4NGUFVzULzeDRis-rT4rPq08\"/><figcaption>素海霖（繪麗奈）悄悄開設全新的Instagram帳號，短短幾天便祭出超狂火辣福利。（IG@thisisshl2026）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"素海霖（繪麗奈）悄悄開設全新的Instagram帳號，短短幾天便祭出超狂火辣福利。（IG@thisisshl2026）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187733728345067520132748.jpeg/1n5uJt4hS8b80VJDPnYtUqY6FdqyJGVllF6bcpRem3I\"/><figcaption>素海霖（繪麗奈）悄悄開設全新的Instagram帳號，短短幾天便祭出超狂火辣福利。（IG@thisisshl2026）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"素海霖（繪麗奈）悄悄開設全新的Instagram帳號，短短幾天便祭出超狂火辣福利。（IG@thisisshl2026）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187734514605363200048167.jpeg/Yl4UUQR9OhDXdO9C-2k9gxmcuY8b91M1JEAZnSRAGZ0\"/><figcaption>素海霖（繪麗奈）悄悄開設全新的Instagram帳號，短短幾天便祭出超狂火辣福利。（IG@thisisshl2026）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"素海霖（繪麗奈）悄悄開設全新的Instagram帳號，短短幾天便祭出超狂火辣福利。（IG@thisisshl2026）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187734512487108608273698.jpeg/ilUvShpb4JrXXjtPfvSHDw9vz6KeAxPG8zuDVPM7g1Q\"/><figcaption>素海霖（繪麗奈）悄悄開設全新的Instagram帳號，短短幾天便祭出超狂火辣福利。（IG@thisisshl2026）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"素海霖（繪麗奈）悄悄開設全新的Instagram帳號，短短幾天便祭出超狂火辣福利。（IG@thisisshl2026）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187734510255607808126374.jpeg/EhS4k0MNjzJnVhlDtTn68sF5JXzGSTwTeXgKpXl4CqU\"/><figcaption>素海霖（繪麗奈）悄悄開設全新的Instagram帳號，短短幾天便祭出超狂火辣福利。（IG@thisisshl2026）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"素海霖（繪麗奈）悄悄開設全新的Instagram帳號，短短幾天便祭出超狂火辣福利。（IG@thisisshl2026）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187734507864723456432689.jpeg/dnvxefqA_hwTabJQKK4GWLfzPcDYOrQaygod_coKHf0\"/><figcaption>素海霖（繪麗奈）悄悄開設全新的Instagram帳號，短短幾天便祭出超狂火辣福利。（IG@thisisshl2026）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"素海霖（繪麗奈）悄悄開設全新的Instagram帳號，短短幾天便祭出超狂火辣福利。（IG@thisisshl2026）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187734516836864000924013.jpeg/Ca_e9gsceRSMv_d_6i8Q4RHXbLMPUK4nYS3CcGEtwnA\"/><figcaption>素海霖（繪麗奈）悄悄開設全新的Instagram帳號，短短幾天便祭出超狂火辣福利。（IG@thisisshl2026）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"素海霖（絵麗奈）舊帳號相片。（IG@thisisshl）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251015/1055253015923134464246971.jpeg/FIFIS36rUUpnMPnkN6FJt_tfJeaAW_BuVEUs_1RFLP8\"/><figcaption>素海霖（絵麗奈）舊帳號相片。（IG@thisisshl）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"素海霖（絵麗奈）舊帳號相片。（IG@thisisshl）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251031/1061006871118221312243850.jpeg/LBIoKwwWr4faQ2ZQS6FZWFjOJygYFYGCGwMPZxsDD2c\"/><figcaption>素海霖（絵麗奈）舊帳號相片。（IG@thisisshl）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"素海霖（絵麗奈）舊帳號相片。（IG@thisisshl）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250508/996949032540966912012584.jpeg/NuhosuVxdlNix-6O1pc8Z8MHDCr82Vf23YXait2F2oo\"/><figcaption>素海霖（絵麗奈）舊帳號相片。（IG@thisisshl）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"素海霖（絵麗奈）舊帳號相片。（IG@thisisshl）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241019/924334259681103872839576.jpeg/EHV1rh2eq5r_qDH8TyvDp8QuyJxTuPsWSN1zMUjdczE\"/><figcaption>素海霖（絵麗奈）舊帳號相片。（IG@thisisshl）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"AV女優素海霖（絵麗奈）（葉志明　攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250531/1005561760377475072583276.jpeg/CRC2c2wCgAZOOAWI7v3byzwUfq5It3ug8LXkO8q15Ds\"/><figcaption>AV女優素海霖（絵麗奈）（葉志明　攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"素海霖（葉志明　攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250128/961057379598864384463289.jpeg/WhxQgGWlHhc21Kmucn2CI_pU-Bk8VXOhX7nXD2W51w8\"/><figcaption>素海霖（葉志明　攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"素海霖（葉志明　攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250128/961057384170917888594172.jpeg/C4IndUMX1taXdY5BhEIUAartB2i7uOpF9SXD3c8lw90\"/><figcaption>素海霖（葉志明　攝）</figcaption></figure><p>香閨內衣照火辣大解放！新帳號加碼曬黑色比堅尼自拍狂扭</p><p>新帳號建立不久，素海霖便毫不吝嗇展現傲人本錢。第一則貼文便是在香閨中身穿性感內衣的火辣自拍照，隨後更加碼曬出一支身著黑色比堅尼的性感短片。</p><p>影片中她對著鏡頭自信扭動身軀、大秀極致身材曲線，讓不少死忠老粉絲興奮湧入留言直誇：「依然這麼正！」、「這身材太辣了，等妳回來！」宣告正式重返社群陣地。</p><p>追蹤名單暗藏玄機！全網獨愛潮流男神Tyson Yoshi一人</p><p>格外引人注目的是，該新帳號目前粉絲追蹤數雖仍在累積階段，但在她的追蹤名單中，全網竟然「唯一追蹤」香港人氣潮流歌手Tyson Yoshi一人，極度專一且高調的舉動立刻成為社群討論焦點！</p><p>更多Tyson Yoshi照片：</p><figure><img alt=\"素海霖（繪麗奈）開設新帳號唯一追蹤的人是Tyson Yoshi。(Tysonyoshi@IG)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250103/951818150818091008238517.png/H0ZpCq7GVVNhPFBokuUROY-oScUoayVXG8V4AxvFeAM\"/><figcaption>素海霖（繪麗奈）開設新帳號唯一追蹤的人是Tyson Yoshi。(Tysonyoshi@IG)</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Tyson Yoshi（陳順禎攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260616/1143632094728032256390127.jpeg/LzeEKqnCrsWTRXMh33D5eRzQQJ_j-OEa1XTHy-N0x8s\"/><figcaption>Tyson Yoshi（陳順禎攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"TYSON YOSHI。（葉志明　攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250910/1042570583117664256246938.jpeg/X0-e-dYk2lNV1jzgrXlvj4fi8NGC9mnxeBMbPHgTGzw\"/><figcaption>TYSON YOSHI。（葉志明　攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"TYSON YOSHI（IG@tysonyoshi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260626/1147310737279160320596307.jpeg/b9LODZWPZtvqTtkoDymEHywslnk0zTJP1zIJRdcyCUU\"/><figcaption>TYSON YOSHI（IG@tysonyoshi）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Tyson Yoshi（IG@tysonyoshi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250103/951818150218043392903614.png/zDhTqiM7THuXQ-l-ihWZ1vs6qgYgzsdVw1Jm0MNSZtA\"/><figcaption>Tyson Yoshi（IG@tysonyoshi）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Tyson Yoshi（IG@tysonyoshi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260930/1181952713471037440164835.jpeg/8Qr3pypwhkSAsOwREirShrKM-A6ZqoFoa3aaBWt2mgU\"/><figcaption>Tyson Yoshi（IG@tysonyoshi）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Tyson Yoshi(Tysonyoshi@IG)\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260916/1176850619609124864654903.jpeg/vo9kylFfFq08YpDFOOeW68ANI9UVoZtd9R4fjfUeH40\"/><figcaption>Tyson Yoshi(Tysonyoshi@IG)</figcaption></figure><p>事實上，素海霖向來不避諱展露對Tyson Yoshi的喜愛，早在2024年樂壇頒獎典禮後，她就曾公開大讚男方穿搭帥氣有型，甚至幽默模仿對方的招牌「低角度俯拍」視角拍照向男神致敬。但可惜剛上線沒多久就再度消失，至今素海霖還未回應。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：素海霖繪麗奈網上「突然被消失」　IG疑似被官方封禁？】素海霖曾上ViuTV節目大爆辛酸。（ViuTV圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260309/1107724381083144192341809.jpeg/NnLvb4ovBwGjI9PMh37ESkqVwHKEBcIYs_Vtk7P1bZM\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：素海霖繪麗奈網上「突然被消失」　IG疑似被官方封禁？】素海霖曾上ViuTV節目大爆辛酸。（ViuTV圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"睇唔到素海霖IG。（截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260529/1137061111565127680961507.png/TwcSyIVxXtzqdEbxa1Lc9tX_0G85qFa0m4WhAZuFoQE\"/><figcaption>睇唔到素海霖IG。（截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"素海霖因出道拍日本AV而人氣急升。（素海霖IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251031/1061006871118221312243850.jpeg/LBIoKwwWr4faQ2ZQS6FZWFjOJygYFYGCGwMPZxsDD2c\"/><figcaption>素海霖因出道拍日本AV而人氣急升。（素海霖IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"素海霖因出道拍日本AV而人氣急升。（素海霖IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251015/1055253015923134464246971.jpeg/FIFIS36rUUpnMPnkN6FJt_tfJeaAW_BuVEUs_1RFLP8\"/><figcaption>素海霖因出道拍日本AV而人氣急升。（素海霖IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"素海霖在活動期間接受傳媒訪問。（資料圖片/葉志明 攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250531/1005562208744116224519263.jpeg/aPLcIe8Lsi2cipFQWZZM29KCEubVTDrtg_WPULn1j1A\"/><figcaption>素海霖在活動期間接受傳媒訪問。（資料圖片/葉志明 攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"繪麗奈（素海霖）相及畫展作品。（葉志明　攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250607/1008040096102092800934158.jpeg/xk1a4otJy6fv7CW64FafkMI9MdMFOQHIg2qli7lqpYs\"/><figcaption>繪麗奈（素海霖）相及畫展作品。（葉志明　攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"繪麗奈（素海霖）相及畫展作品。（葉志明　攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250607/1008040098518142976370241.jpeg/YVcRohDZoYxYGpr1ZPMNnJs9Mv_Wq_W2EsSLXijEi14\"/><figcaption>繪麗奈（素海霖）相及畫展作品。（葉志明　攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"繪麗奈（素海霖）相及畫展作品。（葉志明　攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250607/1008040091551010816098241.jpeg/ZUxQKVOTcf8eQkf4p9CExx7CcG_4vrz-MgDf_QgA3_0\"/><figcaption>繪麗奈（素海霖）相及畫展作品。（葉志明　攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"素海霖（絵麗奈）。（IG@thisisshl）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20241019/924334254882557952362514.jpeg/3A4aKfF04pRIOEbJbb9YB-FEEUX8N49EuulmW7rpZls\"/><figcaption>素海霖（絵麗奈）。（IG@thisisshl）</figcaption></figure><p>親妹是知名AV女優！日人妻瞞尪多年　驚見丈夫手機藏「妹妹影片」</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T09:41:56.023282+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1789,"images":31,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T09:30:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T10:17:40.231009+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T09:37:41.124614+00:00","content_hash":"3e333ec4b5f08a0a849a8e60995b89668b35d41d04b9a67aa6336d1e689cdb67","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}